        "description": "JCM969 explicitly specifies Asahi EBIOS dried-yeast tablets,10g. This source-linked owner denotes the tablet product, not EBIOS P2G yeast extract discussed in historical research. Current official tablet ingredients are evidence for the present product only; the historical source establishes dried-yeast tablet form but not excipient quantities or unchanged composition across time. Bare EBIOS is retained as a rejected unqualified brand label so it cannot globally resolve P2G or other EBIOS products to this tablet owner.",
