        "description": "DSMZ110a defines a filtered meat extract with lean beef OR horse meat alternatives; neither occurrence-level choice nor equivalence of these alternatives is asserted. The DSMZ table uses 500 g meat, 25 ml 1 N NaOH and 975 ml initial water; TOGO M2717 instead tabulates 1000 ml water. Both describe making the resulting filtrate up to 1000 ml. These are source-version alternatives, not reconciled quantities. Extraction/filtration do not prove unchanged meat or NaOH remain in the filtrate. Only water is recorded as a demonstrated retained part; composition and dissolved extraction products remain unspecified.",
