        ],
        "description": "The D-configured N-acetylglucosamine monomer is explicit despite doubled dashes. CHEBI:506227 defines the free monosaccharide; CHEBI:8006 is a peptidoglycan residue/polymer context and is not the ingredient. TOGO M194 is provider-backed; its historical JCM201 endpoint absence does not justify swapping in LB-medium context. JCM1429 lists N-acetyl-D-glucosamine as a free ingredient. The frozen CHEBI:8006 annotation conflicts with this monomer and its formula; the existing CHEBI:506227 owner is correct. Add the exact spaced N -Acetyl spelling and flag the upstream term independently of the alias. Final-review correction: #1226: evidence[1] MANUAL_CURATION→LLM_SUGGESTION; actual LLM authorship, not scientific approval.",
