        "description": "NBRC1625 explicitly specifies L-glutamic acid monosodium salt monohydrate; CHEBI:232425 provides its one-water formula, InChI and SMILES. Preserve that supported structure repair and explicit L alias. DSMZ1454 and JCM904 name sodium glutamate monohydrate; their conventional association follows MAPPING_SEMANTICS §3, rather than independent supplier proof from automatically matched CAS or mass. Neither name-level source association certifies a purchased batch’s enantiomeric purity or crystal phase. CH-05 rejects the two water-free systematic aliases while preserving their exact text/source. All source-specific, role and whole-owner/export holds remain. #1226 corrects the newly agent-authored mapping assertion to LLM_SUGGESTION while preserving inherited objects and actual history.",
