        "description": "Original DSMZ1344 names Taps17.4g atpH8.3. Manufacturer T5130/108320 nomenclature independently establishes conventional TAPS as the free buffer CAS29915-38-6/CHEBI:191055, while this owner is the separate CAS91000-53-2 sodium salt. Preserve rejection of unqualified TAPS on the salt owner and propose a separate free-buffer owner. This does not assert a specific Sigma purchase or infer salt identity from pH. Automatic peptide metadata on MediaDive1188 is unrelated; all publication and provisional-role holds remain. #1226 corrects the newly agent-authored mapping assertion to LLM_SUGGESTION while preserving inherited objects and actual history.",
