        "description": "TOGO2809 places8%(wt/vol) Na2CO3 within the titanium-citrate preparation. It is an80g/L carbonate solution, with100ml addition in that preparation; the frozen100g/L is not the stock concentration. CHEBI:29377 identifies only its solute, and other carbonate stock concentrations are different formulations. Propose a source-qualified8%w/v carbonate stock with a PARTIAL component assertion for the known Na2CO3 solute at80g/L; solvent is not independently specified and is not invented. Final-review correction: #1226: evidence[0] MANUAL_CURATION→LLM_SUGGESTION; actual LLM authorship, not scientific approval.",
