        ],
        "description": "TOGO2809 defines titanium citrate in the LS4D preparation using precursor and carbonate solution steps. The raw titanium-citrate label therefore names a prepared reducing stock, not a pure titanium citrate with known fixed composition; the frozen5g/L cannot substitute for stock addition volume. The complete original TOGO preparation defines500ml0.2M sodium-citrate solution,37.5ml20%w/v TiCl3 solution and100ml8%w/v Na2CO3 under nitrogen. A source-qualified formulation can preserve those batch additions without claiming measured final volume, chemical speciation or an exact pure compound. Existing UNMAPPED_0618 is a distinct generic communitymech source, not proof of the LS4D formulation. Final-review correction: #1226: evidence[0] MANUAL_CURATION→LLM_SUGGESTION; actual LLM authorship, not scientific approval.",
