        "description": "BD-authored SDS identifies catalog228950 as Chocolate Agar Base (GC Medium), manufacturer BD Diagnostic Systems, solid powder. TOGO M2206 paragraph11 explicitly lists six dry-base ingredients totaling36g; paragraph9 dissolves that base in500mL water, while paragraph13 separately prepares500mL water with10g dried bovine hemoglobin. IsoVitaleX is also a separate addition. The components below are only the six named dry-base inputs, with literal source-batch masses. No preparation water, hemoglobin or IsoVitaleX belongs to this dry product. Neither inspected source establishes the Difco sub-brand.",
