        "description": "Sepharose is retained with its original kg_microbe provenance as REJECTED_LABEL for exact agarose identity: Cytiva71709800AF describes spherical agarose-based chromatography resins, including4B/6B and separately cross-linked CL variants, supplied preswollen in20% ethanol. ChEBI:2511 lists Sepharose as a related synonym, not an exact synonym. This does not assert all Sepharose products are cross-linked. The two detached metadata strings are likewise retained as non-resolving REJECTED_LABEL. Existing CARBON_SOURCE computational prediction and its provisional curator note remain unchanged and unapproved; solidifier use neither validates nor disproves organism-dependent utilization. The prior electrophoresis-grade supplied-form annotation remains bounded to NBRC1326.",
