          "changes": "The raw PY-glucose-rumen fluid observation is Treponema socranskii with the source LPSN link naming subsp. paredis. The matched Smibert 1984 abstract describes rumen-fluid or fatty-acid requirements but supplies no source peptone recipe. Full original methods were not recovered. Unrelated Prevotella cultures cannot bind this preparation. Preserve the already withdrawn clarification and all rumen-fluid uncertainty. Withdraw the unsupported peptone component_id and set reference_scope UNMAPPED; retain its existing component_name as historical interpretation, not a newly observed expanded source label. The original assertion method and UNKNOWN/PARTIAL completeness remain unchanged.",
