        "description": "Correct the Polypeptone owner whole-identity boundary with its own registry identity and retire the three Hipolypepton resolving aliases using direct manufacturer evidence. Preserve other source labels and all ambiguous Japanese Polypepton and generic source442 provenance; no forced cross-brand equivalence. Final correction: Correct the exact campaign MappingEvidence method under issue 1226 to LLM_SUGGESTION; preserve its source and claim. Inherited human/process evidence and ComponentEvidence types are unchanged. Supplement: withdraw the two unsupported globally resolving Nihon-qualified Polypepton aliases as provenance-only; date BD evidence, preserve all historical origin fields and exact prior exclusions. Final grounding POLYPEPTONE-001 remains OPEN pending the source-supported coupled owner scope and MICRO exact-term-priority assessment; this self-only fragment is not final grounding approval. Consolidated alias correction: Issue1202 comment6719869255: this label names the specific documented BD casein/animal-tissue blended product. The present owner denotes the supplier-unspecified named Polypeptone preparation; exact interchangeability with this catalogue product is unproved. Preserve the original literal/source as nonresolving provenance. This does not deny the product or prove chemical difference, import its equal-parts formula, mint a BD owner, merge owners, or approve source/role/export. Final selected grounding: Retain supplier-unspecified named Polypeptone as kgmicrobe.ingredient:polypeptone, with a NARROW_MATCH to the closer MeSH D010461 Peptones material category. Native section3 exact-term precedence is evaluated: MICRO:0000179 specifically defines the BD casein/animal-tissue blend and MICRO:0000178 adds enzymatic/mammalian restrictions; neither establishes the generic named material identity. The complete manufacturer guide printed7 supports the peptone partial protein-hydrolysate relation, independently consistent with NLM D010461 and M0016245. This does not import the BD formula or measured lot characteristics. The manufacturer general base-hydrolysis possibility is a terminology caveat, not evidence that these particular observations have a conflicting material. FoodOn member_of external agency categorization is not a source food-use or role prerequisite, so the earlier stronger formal-restriction inference is qualified. FOODON:03315306 and MeSH D011492 remain broader material alternatives; closer verified D010461 is selected under native precedence. None of these mappings transfers the old exact generic FoodOn identity to the named preparation.",
