rd reconstitution. Bind this one previously supported generic material component to the selected actual generic owner mesh:D010461, following exact reviewed W05-FINAL-MAT-039. Native section3 direct unspecified-sense priority supersedes the provisional local parent; no supplier, lot assay, substrate or enzyme inference is added. No other RCM part, quantity, nine-input COMPLETE scope or approximate/performance-adjustment qualification changes. Parent application remains conditional; no global old-ID redirect, named-product equivalence or source/role/export approval.",
