          "changes": "The original Falsen 2005 methods/results text associates Fastidious Anaerobe Broth with Oxoid. Its separately named Anaerobe Systems peptone/yeast/glucose fermentation broth is a different preparation and supplies no FAB recipe. The Neogen NCM0199 sheet is a LabM/Neogen product comparator, unselected for this source. Original Oxoid catalogue/formula and the historical peptone material remain unresolved. The existing meat-granule withdrawal is retained; starch/glucose and other inherited component claims are unchanged and remain unverified. No claim that peptone is absent is made. Withdraw the unsupported peptone component_id and set reference_scope UNMAPPED; retain its existing component_name as historical interpretation, not a newly observed expanded source label. The original assertion method and UNKNOWN/PARTIAL completeness remain unchanged.",
