        "description": "Bounded raw-source alias addition with existing identity/status and prior decisions preserved; The primary JCM437 table spells N-Z Amine,type A(Sheffield), resolving the doubled dash in the frozen label while retaining the type-A qualifier. The supplier description confirms N-Z-Amine A is an enzymatic casein digest; this is not pure casein, TypeB or N-Z-Case by lexical similarity. Combined with independently checked B71 raw lowercase variant from six JCM recipes; retains UNMAPPED and does not assert supplier catalogue equivalence. Successor-v3 adds a metadata-only backlink for the seven explicitly Sheffield/typeA receiving contexts of source1608; four unspecified contexts remain excluded. The exact TypeA owner payload is unchanged.",
