          "CM_NAME:9803a8682677166f67393be93a57b0b142a630f4dfeab4a7397dec3aa9e6a134"
        ],
        "description": "JCM1389 defines this preparation from a grown culture of strain Acc8 (=JCM39386) in JCM Medium1388. Centrifuge the grown culture (source example: 10000 x g for 10 min), remove the supernatant and autoclave it under N2-CO2 (80:20,v/v). The receiving recipe specifies storage under N2 and aseptic anaerobic addition of 400 ml. This denotes the processed culture supernatant, not strain/taxon identity, intact cells, unconditioned Medium1388 or a measured chemical mixture. Growth duration, harvested biomass and metabolite composition are not supplied; no invented component list or quantitative chemical completeness is asserted. Raw label Culture supernatant (see below) is preserved only in this JCM1389 occurrence; it is not a global synonym.",
