        "publication_review_obligation": "Coordinator must compare source-qualified stock equivalence/cross-shard proposals, apply via guarded writers only after full owner review, and preserve all source and publication holds.",
        "limitations": "TOGO M2570 specifies a 10 mL aliquot of 2.5% L-cysteine hydrochloride stock prepared under nitrogen and autoclaved before addition. Nitrogen is a preparation atmosphere, not an asserted bulk solute. Solvent, percentage basis and reagent hydrate are unreported; L stereochemistry and hydrochloride are explicit. The frozen G_PER_L quantity is preserved as a source normalization conflict, not used as stock composition. This is a nominal source-qualified preparation, not a fully resolved chemical formulation. PERCENT preserves the unspecified source percent basis; it is not PERCENT_WV or PERCENT_WW. UNKNOWN component-list completeness records the unreported solvent/preparation inputs. No generic raw source label is made a global resolving synonym and no inherited hold is removed.",
