        "description": "The frozen mediadive.ingredient:2431 source explicitly specifies Duchefa L0230. The manufacturer formulation (https://www.duchefa-biochemie.com/product/details/number/L0230/name/linsmaier-skoog-medium-including-vitamins) and certificate (https://duchefa-biochemie.com/ac/download/number/L0230/id/7087) enumerate mineral macro/microelements, myo-inositol 100 mg/L and thiamine HCl 0.4 mg/L, total 4402.49 mg/L. This identifies the existing imported named-medium owner and its abbreviated source label; it does not identify any single vitamin or imply a supplement-only mixture. Retain UNMAPPED_0427 pending a separately scoped registry promotion; this proposal is exact source/product provenance and alias enrichment.",
        "kind": "edit_existing_owner",
        "source_scope": "Only the cited source-defined formulation / exact ingredient; existing mapping and historical holds preserved.",
        "application_status": "ISOLATED_PROPOSAL_ONLY",
        "integration_requirements": [
          "Apply only against the stated before hash after independent review; synchronize maintained surfaces through the coordinator."
        ],
        "integration_obligations": [
          "Promotion: after independently approved application, move the existing file to data/ingredients/mapped/Linsmaier_Skoog_Medium_Including_Vitamins.yaml, preserving its filename/history; retire placeholder UNMAPPED_0427 without a duplicate owner; synchronize native maintained surfaces and registry SSSOM through supported tools. This proposal does not apply that change or release source/export holds."
        ],
        "independent_review": {
          "status": "pending",
          "evidence_ids": []
        }
      }
    },
