        "description": "The source explicitly specifies DL-asparagine with one water. Wako identifies DL-asparagine monohydrate as CAS 69833-18-7. TCI uses 3130-87-8 for a hydrate product, but that number also appears on generic asparagine records; it is not copied. A distinct CAS 69833-18-7 owner retains a broad relation to CHEBI:22653 asparagine. The supplied form is graded NARROW_MATCH, producing skos:broadMatch to its broader ontology parent.",
        "kind": "new_owner",
        "identity_predicate_alias_consequences": "Preserve source-specific scope and inherited holds. No global alias is inferred from a source-local abbreviation. Registry identities require a registry row; ontology parent relations remain broadMatch. This proposal is not applied and does not approve export.",
