        "description": "Semisolid top-layer preparation of JCM 629, used by CultureMech:010043. Nested carrier input recipe: [[\"NaCl\", \"27.5\", \"G_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"MgCl2·6H2O\", \"5.38\", \"G_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"MgSO4·7H2O\", \"6.78\", \"G_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"KCl\", \"0.72\", \"G_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"NaHCO3\", \"0.2\", \"G_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"CaCl2·2H2O\", \"1.4\", \"G_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"NH4Cl\", \"1.0\", \"G_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"KH2PO4\", \"0.05\", \"G_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"Distilled water\", \"1.0\", \"L_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"]]. JCM 197 trace-mineral stock input recipe: [[\"Nitrilotriacetic acid\", \"4.5\", \"G_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"FeCl2·4H2O\", \"0.4\", \"G_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"MnCl2·4H2O\", \"0.1\", \"G_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"CoCl2·6H2O\", \"0.17\", \"G_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"ZnCl2\", \"0.1\", \"G_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"CaCl2·2H2O\", \"0.02\", \"G_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"H3BO3\", \"0.019\", \"G_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"Na2MoO4·2H2O\", \"0.01\", \"G_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"NiCl2·6H2O\", \"0.03\", \"G_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"Distilled water\", \"1.0\", \"L_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"]], followed by pH 7.0 adjustment with 1N KOH (amount unstated). JCM 197 trace-vitamin stock input recipe: [[\"Biotin\", \"2.0\", \"MG_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"Folic acid\", \"2.0\", \"MG_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"Pyridoxine·HCl\", \"10.0\", \"MG_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"Thiamine·HCl\", \"5.0\", \"MG_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"Riboflavin\", \"5.0\", \"MG_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"Nicotinic acid\", \"5.0\", \"MG_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"Calcium pantothenate\", \"5.0\", \"MG_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"Vitamin B12\", \"0.1\", \"MG_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"p-Aminobenzoic acid\", \"5.0\", \"MG_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"Lipoic acid\", \"5.0\", \"MG_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"], [\"Distilled water\", \"1.0\", \"L_PER_SOURCE_BATCH\"]]. These nested recipes document carrier identity; their water is not counted again as an immediate top-layer component.",
