        "description": "Identical enumerated vitamin preparation in NBRC 1020 and NBRC 824. Ten vitamins with B12 2.7 mg, biotin0.5 mg and folic acid0.9 mg per 1 L water; differs from the common nine-vitamin stock and other starred stocks. NBRC 1020 explicitly filter sterilizes the vitamin stock. NBRC 824 does not specify vitamin-stock filtration: its receiving-medium instruction dissolves all ingredients except terephthalate, sulfide and cysteine before autoclaving. The identical enumeration supports a shared input-stock formula only; the receiving-medium processing differs and processed-medium equivalence is not asserted.",
