        "description": "TOGO M2578 names heat-inactivated fetal-bovine serum and explicitly permits newborn serum as an alternative. This owner represents only the fetal option, not the alternative or an assumed heating schedule. Source-version boundary: this candidate applies only to the fetal option in frozen TOGO M2578 (original primary capture2026-11-08T05:07:01.392375+00:00, SHA256338404e0a53706393f5e37a882b4c66001800a343ab21515fdc28691b6e0f684). That version permits newborn calf serum instead and does not specify a heat schedule. The same linked ATCC0988 URL captured2026-11-08T06:50:20.343881+00:00 (SHA2560233e1b2ca08c89365c67ce6e8e01f2a0d9fa3e20a45c91dc95363feb3c10c9a) explicitly says reformulated as MD2611, names ATCC30-2020, and instructs55C for1hour plus15minutes warmup. Its additive solution is filter sterilized. These current positive facts are not backfilled into the older TOGO material; applying this owner to the current version requires a reviewed version/product/protocol bridge. The frozen transcription is not declared false.",
